# SportsBook UI

## Tokens

- Primary: `#0066FF` (vibrant sports blue)
- Surfaces: `#F7FAFC` / `#FFFFFF`
- Card border: `#E2E8F0`
- Text: `#1A202C` (charcoal), `#718096` (muted grey)
- Radius: `16`–`24` for cards and pill tags

Use `lib/core/app_theme.dart` — do not hardcode scattered hex values.

## Feedback

Every button, text field, and tab must show explicit pressed/focused/selected/disabled states.

```dart
// ❌ BAD
Card(child: content)

// ✅ GOOD
Card(
  color: AppColors.surface,
  shape: RoundedRectangleBorder(
    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(16),
    side: const BorderSide(color: AppColors.border),
  ),
  child: content,
)
```
